notes.body:
I added some updates using `p_set_proto_depth` that make all the tests pass, and then some updates for Follow Stream that enable following either the inner or outer stream properly. I think this should fix the issue, although you can test with other files.

@jimdigriz:

I think so. The latest code should give you an idea of my current thinking.

